Only 14 daggers probably won't be enough to take out a priest.
So dig out three squares of wall - You will want to be outside of
the range of the deity's lightning.  But the mines supply a *lot*
of missiles.  If the priest survives your remote barrage, then you
didn't lug over 200 rocks to the party.  I've taken out some priests
with just the arrows and darts from traps and gnomes plus all of
the daggers I've encountered.  But if you run out of weapon
missiles the priest is completely healed by the time you have
lots of rocks so may as well lug a couple of hundred to a square
beyond the whole in the wall.  Hint - #name/y your rocks and
drop them in bundles of 20 so you don't become stressed when
you pick up your next quiver of them.

After the priest is dead it will make a bunch of sacrafices to
handle the price, but it's still lower than the price of dying to an
angry priest.

A player with create monster spell can take out the priest and
enter a sac/pray cycle that maxes out AC and gives tons of
books.  A player without can still pay the price and enter a
sac-until-artifact cycle that clears out the price of killing the
priest.


